    <p>The Reiny is a deeply calming and stress-relieving bar formulated to detoxify, soothe, and balance irritated or congested skin. The powerful synergy of exotic ylang-ylang and crisp bergamot works to wash away environmental impurities while regulating your skin's natural ecosystems.</p>
