    <ul>
                    <li>Stress-Induced Breakout Control: Ylang-ylang regulates cortisoldriven sebum production, preventing stress-related acne flares</li>
                    <li>Deep Pore Purification: Bergamot acts as a natural antibacterial agent, drawing out deep-seated impurities and toxins</li>
                    <li>Complexion Balancing: The formula expertly harmonizes dry and oily zones, making it ideal for combination skin</li>
                    <li>Hyperpigmentation Fading: Natural compounds in bergamot help even out skin tone and fade stubborn dark spots</li>
                    <li>Cellular Comfort: Anti-inflammatory properties soothe raw, windburned, or itchy skin, restoring a comfortable baseline</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Stressed, acne-prone, or combination skin.</p>
